## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to take ownership under time pressure, address bias ethically, and balance customer impact with product experimentation.

## Key Concepts

- Ownership and accountability in cross-functional triage
- Bias detection, containment, and mitigation in live features
- Trade-off reasoning between hotfix vs rollback vs pausing experiments
- Customer communications and leadership updates without leaking internal data

## Code Example

